  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:18.380" end="00:24.960" ttm:agent="v1">Uhm, something's goin' wrong, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:24.960" end="00:28.050" ttm:agent="v1">Our days are so long, hmn</p>
      <p begin="00:28.050" end="00:32.430" ttm:agent="v1">It feels like we don't belong</p>
      <p begin="00:32.430" end="00:36.740" ttm:agent="v1">Just leave this world behind</p>
      <p begin="00:36.740" end="00:42.900" ttm:agent="v1">We've still got so much to feel</p>
      <p begin="00:42.900" end="00:46.480" ttm:agent="v1">Everything is ours</p>
      <p begin="00:46.480" end="00:49.040" ttm:agent="v1">The shimmer of the waves</p>
      <p begin="00:49.040" end="00:51.290" ttm:agent="v1">Echoes like our dreams</p>
      <p begin="00:51.290" end="00:54.430" ttm:agent="v1">And we just embrace the flow</p>
      <p begin="00:54.430" end="00:57.080" ttm:agent="v1">Playing with the Earth, you know</p>
      <p begin="00:57.080" end="01:01.480" ttm:agent="v1">In this endless glow</p>
      <p begin="01:01.480" end="01:09.480" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:16.310" end="01:19.660" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, so finally</p>
      <p begin="01:19.660" end="01:22.250" ttm:agent="v1">It's started</p>
      <p begin="01:22.250" end="01:26.060" ttm:agent="v1">A crazy days without us</p>
      <p begin="01:26.060" end="01:30.620" ttm:agent="v1">But no one cares about us</p>
      <p begin="01:30.620" end="01:34.940" ttm:agent="v1">So, we just dance, we just dance</p>
      <p begin="01:34.940" end="01:42.940" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:49.750" end="01:53.330" ttm:agent="v1">Everything is ours</p>
      <p begin="01:53.330" end="01:55.920" ttm:agent="v1">The shimmer of the waves</p>
      <p begin="01:55.920" end="01:58.040" ttm:agent="v1">Echoes like our dreams</p>
      <p begin="01:58.040" end="02:01.300" ttm:agent="v1">And we just еmbrace the flow</p>
      <p begin="02:01.300" end="02:03.800" ttm:agent="v1">Playing with the Earth, you know</p>
      <p begin="02:03.800" end="02:06.610" ttm:agent="v1">In this еndless glow</p>
      <p begin="02:06.610" end="02:10.020" ttm:agent="v1">Everything is ours</p>
      <p begin="02:10.020" end="02:12.430" ttm:agent="v1">The shimmer of the waves</p>
      <p begin="02:12.430" end="02:14.690" ttm:agent="v1">Echoes like our dreams</p>
      <p begin="02:14.690" end="02:18.080" ttm:agent="v1">And we just embrace the flow</p>
      <p begin="02:18.080" end="02:20.770" ttm:agent="v1">Dancing with the Earth, you know</p>
      <p begin="02:20.770" end="02:26.250" ttm:agent="v1">In this endless glow</p>
      <p begin="02:26.250" end="02:30.110" ttm:agent="v1">Dancing with us</p>
      <p begin="02:30.110" end="02:34.430" ttm:agent="v1">Dancing with us</p>
      <p begin="02:34.430" end="02:37.340" ttm:agent="v1">Dancing with the Earth, you know</p>
      <p begin="02:37.340" end="02:41.630" ttm:agent="v1">In this endless glow</p>
      <p begin="02:41.630" end="02:45.960" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:45.960" end="02:48.070" ttm:agent="v1">In this endless glow</p>
